WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.959
Are we rolling?

00:00:01.043 --> 00:00:02.211
(laughing)

00:00:02.711 --> 00:00:05.797
- Hi everyone... I'm Clark Backo.
- Lakeith Stanfield.

00:00:05.881 --> 00:00:10.344
We're excited to introduce you to the new
Apple original series, The Changeling.

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:11.512
♪ Dramatic music ♪

00:00:11.595 --> 00:00:13.597
How would you describe this show to a
friend?

00:00:13.764 --> 00:00:17.184
- It's like a fantasy, horror, folklore.
- I'm following it.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:23.899
In general it's a journey of two lovers...
doing everything they need to,

00:00:23.982 --> 00:00:26.985
to... get their baby.
And the gravity of that.

00:00:27.361 --> 00:00:28.779
- I hesitate to describe things.
- Yeah.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.365
Just watch it, just turn it on and watch
it, watch it.

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:32.658
Let it... let it speak to you.

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:34.826
And you come up with your own
conclusions.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:37.704
Y'all smart out there.
You don't need us!

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.415
Emma: When I got to... Brazil.

00:00:40.499 --> 00:00:42.000
There was a lake there, a lagoon.

00:00:42.084 --> 00:00:42.960
♪

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:45.629
They told me not to go, but I didn't
listen.

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:46.713
♪

00:00:46.797 --> 00:00:49.633
Three wishes, before these knots are tied.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.552
Don't cut it!

00:00:51.635 --> 00:00:52.970
Don't cut it!

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:56.431
When it falls off my wrist, three wishes
will come true.

00:00:56.515 --> 00:00:59.268
With me, all of your wishes will come
true.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:05.065
♪ Intense music ♪

00:01:06.817 --> 00:01:07.651
♪

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:08.777
Emma. Emma!

00:01:10.237 --> 00:01:13.198
Doctor: Have you had any thoughts about
hurting yourself?

00:01:13.657 --> 00:01:16.952
Emma: I just need to find... my way back
to myself.

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:18.453
Calisto: People call us witches.

00:01:19.121 --> 00:01:21.123
You know the only real magic,
Apollo...

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:22.666
♪

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:25.002
is in the things you'll do for the ones
you love.

00:01:25.544 --> 00:01:26.545
♪ Dramatic music ♪

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:28.547
Clark: Growing up, I've told you this
before, I loved...

00:01:28.672 --> 00:01:31.091
Sci-fi fantasy, but I never really read
them.

00:01:31.175 --> 00:01:33.760
And then would see a movie get made or a
TV show made...

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:36.930
With the imagination that I had, which is
someone wo looked like me.

00:01:37.014 --> 00:01:39.516
- Mm. Mhmm.
- So one of the big reasons I loved

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.602
"The Changeling" was just reading a story

00:01:41.685 --> 00:01:46.899
that is fantasy, and horror, and
beautiful, and knowing that...

00:01:46.982 --> 00:01:50.235
there's people that look like us that are
the heroes.

00:01:50.319 --> 00:01:52.946
Mhm. I wanna see, you know, Black
characters going through these journeys.

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:54.823
- And...
- Yeah, but they just happen to be Black.

00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:56.617
But yeah, that's the crazy thing about
being Black.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:57.951
All of us just happen to be
Black.

00:01:58.035 --> 00:02:00.412
Lakeith: 'Cause it just really is a... a
human story.

00:02:00.495 --> 00:02:03.290
I just had recently had a kid when I found
out about this story,

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:07.252
so I was just like, damn, I understand
that familial love.

00:02:07.336 --> 00:02:10.130
It's a love unlike any other, but you
gotta like experience it

00:02:10.214 --> 00:02:13.133
to know it... and so, you know, reading
this character felt like

00:02:13.217 --> 00:02:16.512
he had lost that and had to go find
that and go through whatever

00:02:16.595 --> 00:02:17.596
it takes to get there.

00:02:17.679 --> 00:02:18.764
♪

00:02:18.889 --> 00:02:22.893
I'm so excited for fans, because they're
gonna be, I think, pleasantly surprised

00:02:23.101 --> 00:02:25.354
by this just beautiful world that we've
been able to create.

00:02:25.437 --> 00:02:27.856
♪

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:30.776
I really don't think it's one of those
shows where people will guess...

00:02:30.859 --> 00:02:32.819
- Nah, they ain't gonna get it.
- ...What's around the corner, ever.

00:02:32.903 --> 00:02:36.865
Lakeith: Nah. Like when you see the show,
it looks amazing, it looks like

00:02:36.949 --> 00:02:38.825
a different world that you're being zapped
into.

00:02:38.909 --> 00:02:41.662
What did you see? After you did what was
asked of you?

00:02:41.787 --> 00:02:43.038
You know what I saw.

00:02:43.121 --> 00:02:45.499
Lakeith: If you don't pay attention, there
might be something that you missed,

00:02:45.582 --> 00:02:47.292
that'll be a key thing to something else

00:02:47.417 --> 00:02:49.419
You know, I like being excited by things
where I'm like

00:02:49.503 --> 00:02:52.256
- oh I gotta pay attention just to see...
Clark: Yeah.

00:02:52.339 --> 00:02:53.757
- how one key leads to another door.
- And maybe watch it a second time

00:02:53.841 --> 00:02:55.676
And we'll see that in the end.

00:02:55.801 --> 00:02:57.135
♪

00:02:57.261 --> 00:02:58.846
What we doing here is real.

00:02:58.929 --> 00:02:59.972
♪

00:03:00.055 --> 00:03:00.889
Lillian: A storm is coming.

00:03:00.973 --> 00:03:01.974
♪

00:03:02.057 --> 00:03:03.767
Emma: I'm scared for us.

00:03:03.851 --> 00:03:06.937
♪

00:03:08.313 --> 00:03:11.650
No matter what happens,
you're coming with me.

